"by a promotion code of this type is computed: Same as Customer = the "
"referrer gets exactly what the voucher user gets, Fixed = a flat amount, "
"Percentage = a percentage of the referenced document's total, Python Code = "
"a custom formula set through 'Referrer Discount Python Code'."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_promotion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_promotion.field_promotion_type__recognition_method
msgid ""
"How the discount granted by a promotion_code_usage of this type is booked on"
" its journal entry(-ies). Immediate = the customer and referrer journal "
"entry lines debit their Final Account (see 'Discount Account', falling back "
"to the products' own income account) right away, exactly as before this "
"field existed. Deferred = both lines debit 'Deferred Account' instead, so "
"the discount can be recognized later by a separate document."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_promotion
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_promotion.field_promotion_type__referrer_recognition_method
msgid ""
"How the discount granted to the referrer (promotion_code.partner_id) by a "
"promotion_code_usage of this type is booked on its own journal entry: Same "
"as Customer = the referrer follows the voucher user's own 'Recognition "
"Method', Immediate = the referrer journal entry line debits its Final "
"Account right away, Deferred = that line debits 'Referrer Deferred Account' "
"instead, so the referrer's own discount can be recognized later "
"independently of the voucher user's."
msgstr ""

